
Limitation of lock :
Deadlock unrecoverable
Slow critial section 
Priority Inversion 
     Low priority thread can take hold of critical section 
    OS might put on hold lower priority thread
    OS schedule high priority thread , if it needs the shared resource of critial section 
     Lead to unresponsiveness 
Thread not releasea lock / interrupted when holding a lock 
Performace overhead - on waiting for lock (context switch ) and scheduled back (context switch )


Need for lock :
